{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>כרגע</b> — twice in the Masorah in this pericope, and the other: איך היו לשמה כרגע. A hint to the one who says: the congregation of Korah has no portion in the World to Come. And that is what is written: היו לשמה כרגע — ספו תמו — ספו in this world, תמו in the World to Come."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:21.274342616Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}